  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/656398/description_4abe8695-fbe7-49ce-85fb-71af8bf48b5d.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"283\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sun-and-moon-celestial-configuration/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neoforge-1.20 | 1.21-orange?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=D5E0DF&amp;color=D7742F\" alt=\"\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></a> <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sun-and-moon-celestial-configuration/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-1.20 | 1.21-orange?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=E5E5E5&amp;color=C6BCA5\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sun-and-moon-celestial-configuration/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-1.18 | 1.19 | 1.20-orange?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=1E2D44&amp;color=DD984D\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;</strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-orange?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=DDDDDD&amp;color=2D2D2D&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=902121\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-orange?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=D5E0DF&amp;color=7289DA&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=5865F2\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></h4><hr><h4><strong><br>📖 关于：</strong></h4><p>想让您的世界在视觉上变得有趣，但又不会过于显眼吗？<br>现在你可以通过一个精巧的配置文件来改变太阳和/或月亮的大小了！<br><br></p><hr><h4><strong><br>✅ 功能：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>改变太阳和月亮的大小！</li>\n<li>默认设置保持大小不变</li>\n<li>配置文件允许您缩放高度和宽度</li>\n<li>太阳和月亮可以单独缩放</li>\n<li>目前支持 Forge、Neoforge 和 Fabric</li>\n<li>Fabric 版本需要 Fabric API 和 Cloth Config<br><br></li>\n</ul><hr><h4><strong><br>🔧 配置：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>太阳的高度和宽度倍数</li>\n<li>月亮的高度和宽度倍数<br><br></li>\n</ul><hr><h4><br>🖼️ <strong>预览：</strong></h4><p>演示模组运行效果的视频示例，使用了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-mods-button\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Mods Button</a> 进行优化：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/d7Bs0pKrYkQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252finfernalstudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/656398/description_31c00bb5-7a37-4164-9297-f63f181a8f1a.gif\" width=\"600\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
